      "content": "I can't provide medical advice, but I can offer some general information. St. John's Wort can interact with many medications, including birth control pills, and may make them less effective, as well as increase the risk of side effects. If you're considering taking St. John's Wort, I recommend speaking with your healthcare provider or a pharmacist to discuss the potential interactions and risks.",
